{
  "version": 2,
  "metadata": {
    "title": "Demostración de Presentations Open",
    "subject": "Cobertura de texto, tablas, charts y diagramas",
    "author": "Skill QA"
  },
  "theme": {
    "font_name": "Roboto",
    "title_color": "17324D",
    "body_color": "243B53",
    "accent_color": "C8102E",
    "background_color": "FFFFFF",
    "safe_margin_inches": 0.6,
    "title_pt": 32,
    "body_pt": 18
  },
  "font_policy": { "basis": "design", "families": ["Roboto"] },
  "requirements": {
    "total_slides": 5,
    "required_native_table_slides": [3],
    "required_native_chart_slides": [4, 5],
    "arithmetic_contracts": [
      {
        "slide": 3,
        "table": 1,
        "operation": "sum",
        "inputs": [[1, 1], [2, 1]],
        "result": [3, 1],
        "tolerance": "0",
        "decimal_separator": ".",
        "thousands_separator": ","
      }
    ]
  },
  "slides": [
    {
      "kind": "cover",
      "title": "Presentaciones editables con Python",
      "subtitle": "Una comprobación práctica del flujo abierto",
      "notes": "La portada se incluye en el recuento total de cinco diapositivas."
    },
    {
      "title": "El contenido se distribuye en columnas legibles",
      "layout_mode": "two_columns",
      "items": [
        "La automatización conserva el orden de lectura al repartir bloques entre columnas.",
        { "runs": [{ "text": "Cada idea", "bold": true }, { "text": " se mantiene en un contenedor breve y puede editarse directamente en PowerPoint." }] },
        "El tamaño de cuerpo se mantiene legible antes de considerar una reducción tipográfica.",
        "Los márgenes seguros y la revisión visual completan el control geométrico automatizado."
      ],
      "sources": ["Fuente de ejemplo: guía de QA de Presentations Open"]
    },
    {
      "title": "Las tablas conservan los valores editables",
      "table": {
        "headers": ["Partida", "Importe"],
        "rows": [
          ["Operaciones", "40"],
          ["Tecnología", "60"],
          ["Total", "100"]
        ],
        "column_weights": [2, 1],
        "header_rows": 1,
        "font_size_pt": 16,
        "stripe_fill": "F1F5F8"
      },
      "notes": "El contrato aritmético comprueba el total explícito."
    },
    {
      "title": "Los charts mantienen categorías y series editables",
      "chart": {
        "chart_type": "column",
        "categories": ["Norte", "Sur", "Este"],
        "series": [
          { "name": "Ingresos", "values": [12.5, 9.7, 14.2], "number_format": "0.0" },
          { "name": "Margen", "values": [4.1, 3.6, 5.2], "number_format": "0.0" }
        ],
        "legend": { "position": "bottom" },
        "data_labels": { "show_value": true, "position": "outside_end", "number_format": "0.0", "font_size_pt": 10 },
        "axes": { "value": { "minimum": 0, "major_gridlines": true, "font_size_pt": 10 } }
      },
      "sources": ["Fuente de ejemplo: datos sintéticos para validar el compilador"]
    },
    {
      "title": "Un mismo slide puede combinar objetos nativos",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "textbox",
          "name": "explanation",
          "x": 0.8,
          "y": 1.55,
          "width": 4.6,
          "height": 2.0,
          "text": {
            "paragraphs": [
              { "runs": [{ "text": "Texto enriquecido", "bold": true, "color": "C8102E" }, { "text": " con una segunda frase enlazada.", "hyperlink": "https://python-pptx.readthedocs.io/" }], "space_after_pt": 8 },
              { "text": "Las formas solo representan los nodos del proceso de ejemplo." }
            ]
          },
          "style": { "font_name": "Roboto", "font_size_pt": 17, "color": "243B53", "margins_in": { "left": 0.08, "right": 0.08, "top": 0.04, "bottom": 0.04 } }
        },
        {
          "type": "shape",
          "name": "node-a",
          "shape_type": "flow_start_end",
          "x": 6.1,
          "y": 1.8,
          "width": 2.3,
          "height": 0.85,
          "fill": "E7F0F4",
          "line_color": "17324D",
          "text": "Entrada",
          "text_style": { "font_name": "Roboto", "font_size_pt": 17, "color": "17324D", "alignment": "center", "vertical_anchor": "middle" }
        },
        {
          "type": "connector",
          "name": "node-link",
          "start": { "x": 8.4, "y": 2.225 },
          "end": { "x": 9.1, "y": 2.225 },
          "color": "63788A",
          "width_pt": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "shape",
          "name": "node-b",
          "shape_type": "flow_process",
          "x": 9.1,
          "y": 1.8,
          "width": 2.7,
          "height": 0.85,
          "fill": "FCE9EC",
          "line_color": "C8102E",
          "text": "Resultado",
          "text_style": { "font_name": "Roboto", "font_size_pt": 17, "color": "17324D", "alignment": "center", "vertical_anchor": "middle" }
        },
        {
          "type": "chart",
          "name": "small-scatter",
          "chart_type": "scatter",
          "x": 6.1,
          "y": 3.2,
          "width": 5.7,
          "height": 2.6,
          "series": [
            { "name": "Mediciones", "x_values": [1, 2, 3, 4], "values": [2, 3, 2.5, 4] }
          ],
          "legend": false,
          "axes": { "value": { "minimum": 0, "maximum": 5, "major_gridlines": true } }
        }
      ],
      "notes": "El ejemplo combina texto con formato, formas, conectores, chart y notas."
    }
  ]
}
